
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">

  <title>Join the Club | ChatterBox</title>

  <style>
    * {
      box-sizing: border-box;
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
    }

    body {
      font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;
      background: #f3f6fb;
      color: #1e293b;
      line-height: 1.6;
      min-height: 100vh;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
    }

    a {
      text-decoration: none;
    }

    .topbar {
      background: #111827;
      color: white;
      padding: 20px 5%;
    }

    .topbar-content {
      width: min(1100px, 100%);
      margin: 0 auto;
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 18px;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
    }

    .brand h1 {
      font-size: 26px;
      line-height: 1.3;
    }

    .brand p {
      color: #cbd5e1;
      font-size: 13px;
      margin-top: 4px;
    }

    .home-link {
      color: #e2e8f0;
      font-size: 14px;
      font-weight: 600;
      padding: 9px 13px;
      border: 1px solid #4b5563;
      border-radius: 7px;
      transition: background 0.2s;
    }

    .home-link:hover {
      background: #374151;
    }

    main {
      width: min(480px, 92%);
      margin: auto;
      padding: 42px 0;
    }

    .membership-card {
      background: white;
      border: 1px solid #e2e8f0;
      border-radius: 16px;
      padding: 34px;
      box-shadow: 0 12px 35px rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.07);
    }

    .icon-wrapper {
      width: 58px;
      height: 58px;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      background: #ede9fe;
      border-radius: 14px;
      font-size: 28px;
      margin-bottom: 22px;
    }

    .eyebrow {
      color: #5b21b6;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      font-size: 11px;
      font-weight: 700;
      letter-spacing: 1.2px;
      margin-bottom: 7px;
    }

    h2 {
      color: #0f172a;
      font-size: 28px;
      line-height: 1.3;
      margin-bottom: 10px;
    }

    .description {
      color: #64748b;
      font-size: 14px;
      margin-bottom: 25px;
    }

    .error-message {
      background: #fef2f2;
      color: #b91c1c;
      border: 1px solid #fecaca;
      border-radius: 8px;
      padding: 12px 14px;
      font-size: 13px;
      margin-bottom: 20px;
      overflow-wrap: anywhere;
    }

    .form-group {
      margin-bottom: 20px;
    }

    label {
      display: block;
      color: #334155;
      font-size: 13px;
      font-weight: 700;
      margin-bottom: 8px;
    }

    .input-wrapper {
      position: relative;
    }

    input {
      display: block;
      width: 100%;
      padding: 13px 14px;
      border: 1px solid #cbd5e1;
      border-radius: 8px;
      background: #fff;
      color: #0f172a;
      font: inherit;
      font-size: 14px;
      outline: none;
      transition: border-color 0.2s, box-shadow 0.2s;
    }

    input:focus {
      border-color: #4f46e5;
      box-shadow: 0 0 0 3px rgba(79, 70, 229, 0.12);
    }

    .hint {
      color: #94a3b8;
      font-size: 12px;
      margin-top: 8px;
    }

    .submit-btn {
      display: block;
      width: 100%;
      padding: 13px 16px;
      background: #4f46e5;
      color: white;
      border: none;
      border-radius: 8px;
      font-size: 14px;
      font-weight: 700;
      cursor: pointer;
      transition: background 0.2s, transform 0.2s;
    }

    .submit-btn:hover {
      background: #4338ca;
    }

    .submit-btn:active {
      transform: scale(0.99);
    }

    .security-note {
      display: flex;
      align-items: flex-start;
      gap: 9px;
      background: #f8fafc;
      border: 1px solid #e2e8f0;
      border-radius: 8px;
      padding: 12px;
      margin-top: 22px;
      color: #64748b;
      font-size: 12px;
    }

    .security-note span {
      flex-shrink: 0;
    }

    .bottom-link {
      text-align: center;
      margin-top: 23px;
      font-size: 13px;
      color: #64748b;
    }

    .bottom-link a {
      color: #4f46e5;
      font-weight: 700;
    }

    .bottom-link a:hover {
      text-decoration: underline;
    }

    .footer {
      padding: 20px 15px;
      text-align: center;
      color: #94a3b8;
      font-size: 12px;
      margin-top: auto;
    }

    @media (max-width: 480px) {
      .topbar {
        padding: 17px 4%;
      }

      .brand h1 {
        font-size: 23px;
      }

      main {
        width: 92%;
        padding: 28px 0;
      }

      .membership-card {
        padding: 25px 20px;
      }

      h2 {
        font-size: 25px;
      }
    }
  </style>
</head>

<body>
  <header class="topbar">
    <div class="topbar-content">
      <div class="brand">
        <h1>ChatterBox</h1>
        <p>Become a member of our exclusive clubhouse!</p>
      </div>

      <a href="/" class="home-link">← Back to Home</a>
    </div>
  </header>

  <main>
    <section class="membership-card">
      <div class="icon-wrapper" aria-hidden="true">🔐</div>

      <p class="eyebrow">Membership Access</p>

      <h2>Join the Club</h2>

      <p class="description">
        Enter the secret club passcode to unlock membership
        and see who is sharing messages in the community.
      </p>

      <% if (error) { %>
        <div class="error-message" role="alert">
          <%= error %>
        </div>
      <% } %>

      <form action="/join-club" method="POST">
        <div class="form-group">
          <label for="passcode">Secret Passcode</label>

          <div class="input-wrapper">
            <input
              type="password"
              id="passcode"
              name="passcode"
              placeholder="Enter your club passcode"
              required
              autocomplete="off"
              autofocus
            >
          </div>

          <p class="hint">
            Enter the passcode provided to club members.
          </p>
        </div>

        <button class="submit-btn" type="submit">
          Join the Club →
        </button>
      </form>

      <div class="security-note">
        <span aria-hidden="true">🔒</span>
        <p>
          Your membership is saved to your account after
          successful verification.
        </p>
      </div>

      <p class="bottom-link">
        Changed your mind?
        <a href="/">Return to the community</a>
      </p>
    </section>
  </main>

  <footer class="footer">
    ChatterBox &copy; <%= new Date().getFullYear() %>
    &mdash; Connect, share, and belong.
  </footer>
</body>
</html>
